  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary repair path",
      "items": [
        "main.py: 3 initial-cleanup iterations \u2192 temporary binary STL \u2192 advanced repair \u2192 output; temporary file removed after stage 2.",
        "Advanced: shell union/filtering, topology separation, winding, welding and hole patches. NumPy arrays stay in one repair process."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Convergence & output checks",
      "items": [
        "Up to 3 refinement passes; structural regressions roll back. Final winding audit and float32 split stabilization precede export/reload analysis.",
        "Completion does not guarantee watertightness. The 300 s internal check is cooperative; local batch evaluation adds a 120 s default hard timeout + CSV."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust & optional dependencies",
      "items": [
        "Input STL and remote dataset bytes cross trust boundaries. INI/paths are operator controlled; libraries share process privileges. Boundaries are not sandboxes.",
        "NumPy/numpy-stl; SciPy fallbacks; optional trimesh Boolean backend. HTTPS evaluator launches main.py without a hard timeout; streaming evaluation calls advanced repair directly.",
        "Evidence: current modified working tree; main.py, src/pipelines, src/core, src/routines and src/scripts."
      ]
    }
